ed all those important times in  her life her getting married having kids  and even a granddaughter buzz has spent  so much time fighting for a life he  himself has forgotten how to live one  and on his last failed mission he  returns home to find that alicia has  passed away for me it was one of the  most emotional scenes in the entire  movie the new commander burnside decides  to axe buzz's mission and instead have  humanity live under a giant laser shield  this also means socks will be  decommissioned but there's just one  problem over these past 60 years that  buzz has been flying into space sox has  finally come up with the perfect  calculation to make the fuel stable  enough to reach hyperspeed so buzz has  to run from the authorities and escape  the planet even though he's been told  his mission's been terminated but we  know buzz does what he wants and he  successfully evades capture and ventures  into space to prove once and for all he  can complete the mission and complete it  he does returning back to earth 22 years  later but something very bad has  happened since he was gone a week before  his arrival an alien spaceship has  surrounded the colony and only a few  remain to fight back it's here buzz  teams up with alicia's granddaughter  izzy who is now all grown up the alien  spaceship is controlled by zerg who you  may remember first seeing in toy story 2  and played a much larger role in the  buzz lightyear of star command  television show he is the sworn enemy of  the galactic alliance and arch enemy of  buzz and there's a big twist surrounding  him in this movie but we'll get into  that in a bit so buzz makes it to  outpost 3 where we meet the rest of  izzy's ragtag crew there's mo voiced by  taiko ati and our favorite elderly  convict darby a real no-nonsense gruff  type who can take any three objects and  make them explode there they go over the  plan for operation surprise party which  entails blowing up the alien ship so the  robots below break down it could be a  coincidence but the buzz lightyear  action figure andy got for his birthday  was a surprise and not in his original  pile of presents but this plan has one  major problem they need a ship but  luckily there's one in the abandoned  bug-infested space dock what could go  wrong it's in this scene we really see  how buzz still has a long way to go to  overcome his flaw of accepting help he  still wants to do everything on his own  and it actually gets them all into a  heap ton of trouble with the entire crew  narrowly making out of the depot with  the ship after evading a giant bug  attack but just when it looks like  they've made an escape zerg attacks the  ship crash landing it on the dark side  of the planet luckily the nearby  terrillium mine just might have the part  needed to fix their ship so they make  their way over it's here we get a  heartfelt story from buzz who tells a  story about how he almost quit star  academy in the first week he kept making  mistakes but it was his grandma who told  him to keep going only by making  mistakes can we get better and that's a  lesson buzz seems to have forgotten has  he made mistakes sure but he has to get  up and keep trying this will be tested  even further when they're attacked by  zerg and his gang of robots the weird  thing here is that zerg only seems to be  after buzz but why in a spectacular  space chase across the planet's lava  fields zerg's robots gain control of the  hyper-speed fuel and teleport back to  the ship everything buzz has worked for  for more than 80 years is gone in an  instant he finally concedes that his  mission is over but if things couldn't  get any worse buzz is attacked by zerg  and teleported to the alien ship but  zerg doesn't want to kill him in fact  the big reveal is that zerg is buzzed  well a much much older version than  himself so how on earth is this possible  this buzz comes from an alternate  timeline one in which the hyper speed  fuel actually worked but he had to  escape burnside who expressly told him  that the mission was over and that he's  now to be arrested so this buzz escapes  takes the hyper-speed fuel with him and  travels so far into the future that he  uncovered an alien ship with futuristic  tech it was here he discovered that if  you could use this fuel to go into the  future why not the past so he ends up  using the rest of the fuel to travel  back in time exactly one week before our  buzz lands on the planet now that he has  young buzz's fuel the two of them can go  back in time together and reset  everything so the colony can venture off  to its original destination as planned  but young buzz is met with a dilemma  does he follow old buzz's plan to  complete the mission or does he refuse  and go with his friends if he goes with  old buzz it means izzy will no longer  exist alicia will never have lived the  full life she had and not to mention  countless others it's buzz's decision  not to help old buzz that proves he  truly puts others before himself and the  mission of course old buzz or zerg as  i'll call him is not happy about this  and the two battle it out luckily buzz  has his friends there to help him  something he said he never needed at the  beginning of the movie izzy also has to  overcome her fear of space to save him  and even darby and mo hold back a horde  of robots buzz sets a self-destruct on  the big alien ship and is able to  teleport to his smaller ship using the  same alien teleportation device the  robots used but there's one final battle  as buzz's ship crash lands to earth zerg  appears out of nowhere and rips the  hyper-speed fuel out of the ship and in  a heroic scene where we get to see buzz  use his space wings for the first time  he blasts zerg into space but at the  same time loses the fuel that could save  him with the entire crew safely back on  the planet and the colony saved izzy  asks if buzz will miss home now that he  has no way of getting back but he tells  her this 