now feels like home and  although he's chewed out by burnside for  his actions buzz is ultimately given  full command of the space rangers with  the ability to choose the best of the  best to join his ranks but he tells  burnside he already has the best crew  izzy moe and darby well let's not forget  socks and the last line of the movie is  the iconic to infinity and beyond the  stubborn-headed buzz at the beginning of  the film who only did things on his own  and cared only about the mission has  completely turned into the opposite one  who supports his friends and puts them  before anything else now six-year-old  andy would have come out of the theater  loving this movie and telling his mom  just how much he wants a buzz lightyear  action figure now there are three extra  scenes after the movie finishes two of  them don't really add anything to the  story but one leaves room open for a  potential sequel now these are really  short so i won't spend a lot of time  talking about them but the first is a  burnside watching a bug zap on the laser  shield the second is a robot explaining  the directions on how to get to the  space depot and the third is the big one  we see zerg floating through space and  his eyes turn back on  will zerg return in one form or another  and how does he escape the depths of  space but what did you think of  lightyear was this a step into the  future or should disney have left this  toy behind i want to hear your thoughts  and theories in the comments below  thanks for watching everyone for more  bad takes you can follow me on twitter  and instagram at think story yt until  next time remember that was utterly  terrifying and i regret having joined  you  you


